        "text": "<p>We never set out to create fashion for the sake of fashion.</p><p>We set out to build something that reflected intention over attention, where every garment began with an idea before it became a product.</p><p>Every decision we make; from the concepts we explore to the fabrics we choose, is guided by that same belief.</p><p>Because what we wear should never speak louder than the person wearing it.</p>",
